        },
        {
          "text": " Naa ore ake enkata naba anaa enadumuni ilo sanduku aaya, nejo Musa, “Tudumunye, iyie Olaitoriani, naa nchoo ilmang'ati linono eisardak naa nchoo lelo likimba iyie eilanyisho te dukuya iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.35",
