              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ore ake pee eirragieki, nejo ninye, “Torrinyokinoyu iyie Olaitoriani nkalifuni iip tomon oo Siraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
